## Placement & state
- Control sits in the **Display popover** beside *Show archived* — the same `Checkbox` + `label`
  pattern already at `ConceptView.tsx` (no new toolbar real estate).
- **Sticky** — remembered per concept (localStorage / URL), so the Vendors view stays in edit mode.
- **Active cue** (so the mode isn't invisible): accent dot on the Display button + a small "Editing"
  pill that also acts as a one-click exit; editable cells additionally show a hover affordance.

## Interaction
- One field per edit → `updateInstance(id, version, { [fieldId]: value })`.
- Optimistic local write, reconciles via the live SSE collection. Version clash → cell flags + refetch.
- Editors reused from `InstanceForm.renderInput`: bool=checkbox · enum=dropdown · user=member picker
  · number/text/date inputs. **computed** cells = read-only; **relation/file** aren't columns (edit in detail).

**Forks captured here:** entry = toggle **inside the Display menu** (not a standalone chip) · sticky
per-concept preference · per-cell autosave · active-state indicator to keep the mode visible.
